WEBVTT

00:11.770 --> 00:12.650
Get up, Leon!

00:13.090 --> 00:15.530
You're next in line to become the king!

00:15.990 --> 00:17.980
Y-Yes, Father!

00:18.240 --> 00:22.320
Lord Leon is kind at heart.

00:22.320 --> 00:24.900
And that's a problem, Master.

00:25.880 --> 00:27.070
Matilda!

00:27.460 --> 00:30.080
Have you no shame?

00:30.950 --> 00:33.670
Father, let me fight, too!

00:33.670 --> 00:36.000
It's not fair that only 
my brother gets to do it!

00:36.000 --> 00:42.590
No fair, no fair, no fair...

00:36.210 --> 00:39.630
Matilda, this isn't a game.

00:43.160 --> 00:46.070
Know your place as a princess!

00:46.750 --> 00:50.130
Change into a dress and 
go read in your room!

00:50.820 --> 00:52.000
Fine.

00:53.400 --> 00:56.690
What am I going to do with that tomboy?

01:01.870 --> 01:04.420
I heard you got in trouble with Father again.

01:06.510 --> 01:09.230
Whatever! I hate Father.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.370
I want to study martial arts, too.

01:11.810 --> 01:16.360
Aw, man. I wish I hadn't been born a princess.

01:18.380 --> 01:20.250
Now, Matilda...

01:22.300 --> 01:25.030
Listen closely to what I'm about to say.

01:30.190 --> 01:33.430
You fool. Why did you come?

01:33.770 --> 01:39.520
I thought my main dish would come 
running if I used her father as bait.

01:39.970 --> 01:43.990
I swear I'll defeat you 
with my own two hands.

01:44.440 --> 01:49.350
It'd be a shame to eat you in a single 
bite instead of savoring this meal.

01:49.350 --> 01:52.330
Before you die, let's 
have some entertainment.

02:01.790 --> 02:02.640
Matilda!

02:14.340 --> 02:17.610
<i>Th-That was Father's technique...</i>

02:18.140 --> 02:21.970
Surprised? This is my overpowered skill:

02:23.010 --> 02:24.600
Gluttony.

02:25.810 --> 02:30.830
Not only do I gain increased abilities 
depending on the flesh I eat,

02:30.830 --> 02:34.890
but I even gain the ability to use 
skills possessed by said flesh.

02:35.490 --> 02:42.750
In other words, you will be torn apart by your 
father's own skills before you're eaten by me.

02:43.430 --> 02:47.390
Now... it's dinnertime.

02:49.020 --> 02:54.020
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:55.240 --> 02:57.080
Impressive as always, Sensei.

02:57.080 --> 03:00.270
It was your plan all along to sneak in this way.

03:00.540 --> 03:03.850
Knowing him, I thought he 
actually wanted to be eaten.

03:03.850 --> 03:07.100
But if you really think about it, 
nobody would actually want that.

03:11.530 --> 03:12.710
Is this the place?

03:12.710 --> 03:15.270
Huh? We're not going to see the Other Worlder?

03:15.270 --> 03:18.450
That's right. We must go teach him a lesson.

03:18.450 --> 03:20.710
No, here is fine.

03:24.810 --> 03:26.320
The queen's room?

03:26.800 --> 03:28.560
W-Wait, Sensei!

03:29.910 --> 03:31.570
What a small medal.

03:31.570 --> 03:33.550
I'm not sure you should be doing that.

03:35.020 --> 03:36.990
What are you even doing?

03:36.990 --> 03:39.860
I thought we were going to 
defeat that Kaibara guy!

03:41.360 --> 03:44.160
Your services are needed, valiant warrior.

03:44.160 --> 03:47.780
Oh, fine. I guess I can help.

03:58.670 --> 04:01.300
Nicely done, Nir-kun.

04:03.700 --> 04:05.650
You're still standing?

04:05.650 --> 04:07.090
Huh.

04:08.190 --> 04:09.840
But it's no use.

04:11.690 --> 04:13.170
Tiger Kick.

04:16.970 --> 04:18.890
Lion's Blade.

04:24.660 --> 04:26.940
Didn't your father tell you?

04:27.210 --> 04:31.290
Your paltry martial arts are useless.

04:33.230 --> 04:34.670
Leon.

04:36.650 --> 04:38.330
Hey, Leon.

04:38.840 --> 04:40.790
Hey, Leon!

04:42.450 --> 04:45.530
Why do you train all the time?

04:45.530 --> 04:48.060
I thought you didn't like fighting.

04:49.770 --> 04:53.680
You're right. Honestly, 
I'm not very good at fighting.

04:53.960 --> 04:56.930
You might even have more 
talent for it than me.

04:57.230 --> 04:59.130
But you know, Matilda...

05:00.620 --> 05:04.610
That's why I have to work 
harder than everyone else.

05:05.010 --> 05:07.900
I want to become strong like Father

05:07.900 --> 05:12.740
so I can be a prince capable of protecting 
you, Mother, and this entire nation.

05:23.780 --> 05:25.130
Good grief.

05:26.060 --> 05:28.100
Enough, Matilda.

05:28.510 --> 05:32.040
Don't you realize how much stronger he is?

05:32.840 --> 05:36.520
I know, Father. But still...

05:37.150 --> 05:42.740
Despite that, Leon would never give up!

05:46.510 --> 05:49.430
Fantastic! You're incredible!

05:51.580 --> 05:59.140
I feel truly alive when I eat 
spirited flesh like yours.

05:59.990 --> 06:05.080
Oh, marvelous! I can say 
it with certainty now!

06:05.080 --> 06:10.370
All those fruitless days I spent in my 
past life were leading up to this day!

06:15.350 --> 06:19.800
In my old world, I may 
as well have been dead.

06:21.350 --> 06:23.770
Born in a mansion that was 
practically a castle,

06:23.770 --> 06:27.520
my parents bought me everything I wanted.

06:28.000 --> 06:31.740
Every day, my table was filled 
with luxurious dishes

06:32.190 --> 06:35.200
as my own heart grew emptier and emptier.

06:35.730 --> 06:38.190
Then, one day, I had a thought.

06:39.740 --> 06:43.850
"I wish I felt alive."

06:55.180 --> 07:00.390
But my wish went unsatisfied, 
and I remained unfulfilled.

07:01.240 --> 07:03.120
Of course I was.

07:03.590 --> 07:08.260
From the start, I was nothing more 
than livestock kept in a cage.

07:10.180 --> 07:14.850
Everyone called me fortunate.

07:16.770 --> 07:18.920
Me, fortunate?

07:25.870 --> 07:27.660
You must be joking.

07:30.190 --> 07:34.270
I was... I was... I was...

07:39.560 --> 07:44.050
I was the most miserable 
person in the world.

07:50.580 --> 07:53.460
That's how I came to this world.

07:54.060 --> 07:59.440
And now I eat whatever I want 
according to my own will!

07:59.440 --> 08:02.420
I'm not livestock anymore!

08:02.660 --> 08:07.870
Now fulfill me with your supreme flavor!

08:10.020 --> 08:13.250
Don't, Kaibara! Please don't!

08:13.580 --> 08:16.150
Matilda!

08:19.720 --> 08:22.180
What a boring story.

08:24.390 --> 08:26.180
I couldn't bear to listen.

08:26.180 --> 08:29.650
Huh? Sensei?

08:35.820 --> 08:38.980
<i>Why won't it move? This 
has never happened before.</i>

08:39.720 --> 08:41.050
<i>What is this?</i>

08:41.710 --> 08:45.460
<i>My instincts are refusing to eat this man?</i>

08:45.760 --> 08:48.060
Who are you?

08:48.410 --> 08:51.130
Hold it right there, evil Other Worlder.

08:51.960 --> 08:54.830
You're about to receive divine punishment.

08:54.830 --> 08:56.390
You're finished.

08:56.730 --> 09:01.450
Sensei has the ability to banish 
Other Worlders from this world.

09:01.450 --> 09:02.090
What?

09:02.090 --> 09:03.800
What was that?

09:03.800 --> 09:07.890
Now, Sensei! Write Kaibara's story!

09:08.580 --> 09:11.770
Use your Gift, "Storyteller"!

09:11.770 --> 09:13.520
No, I won't be doing that.

09:15.720 --> 09:21.460
This boring man's boasting about his own 
misfortune isn't worth writing about.

09:23.660 --> 09:26.830
Well, you piss me off.

09:28.140 --> 09:30.130
I am a predator!

09:41.340 --> 09:42.960
I'll kill you.

09:42.960 --> 09:46.570
Before I eat the demi princess, 
I'll kill you all!

09:48.530 --> 09:49.350
Nir-san!

09:49.700 --> 09:52.310
Nir-san, wake up!

09:55.090 --> 09:56.770
<i>This is my fault.</i>

09:57.580 --> 10:00.530
<i>If I hadn't insisted on fighting...</i>

10:01.110 --> 10:04.530
<i>If I'd stopped Annette and the others then...</i>

10:05.110 --> 10:08.330
<i>If I never thought I could take Leon's place...</i>

10:08.770 --> 10:11.750
<i>None of this would've happened.</i>

10:13.170 --> 10:16.310
It's all my fault.

10:20.750 --> 10:22.100
Sensei...

10:23.060 --> 10:26.320
What should I do?

10:30.780 --> 10:33.190
I dedicate this story to you.

10:34.380 --> 10:36.390
I'd like you to read it.

10:37.450 --> 10:41.340
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:37.960 --> 10:41.340
Will You
Sentence
Me to Death
Again?

10:41.340 --> 10:42.170
Will You
Sentence
Me to Death
Again?

10:41.340 --> 10:42.210
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:42.170 --> 10:42.210
Will You
Sentence
Me to Death
Again?

10:42.210 --> 10:42.250
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:42.210 --> 10:42.250
Will You
Sentence
Me to Death
Again?

10:42.260 --> 10:42.300
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:42.300 --> 10:42.380
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:42.380 --> 10:42.420
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:47.940 --> 10:54.540
As I had hoped, your ill-fated 
destiny was worth writing about.

10:55.410 --> 10:58.250
Now turn the page.

11:04.580 --> 11:07.920
<i>That's Sensei's Gift.</i>

11:07.920 --> 11:10.380
<i>Does it work on non-Other Worlders, as well?</i>

11:12.110 --> 11:13.050
Shield!

11:17.450 --> 11:19.850
What are you looking at?

11:20.930 --> 11:26.020
The more I learned about your 
past, the more I thought...

11:26.620 --> 11:33.170
Because you are so kind, you 
suppress your own true feelings.

11:33.480 --> 11:35.950
You're a clumsy woman.

11:36.650 --> 11:38.850
Due to that, as a child,

11:38.840 --> 11:44.800
you were bound by your father's vision 
of an ideal princess and troubled by it.

11:46.140 --> 11:50.960
After your family's tragedy, in order 
to raise your father's spirits,

11:50.960 --> 11:56.160
you tried earnestly to replace your 
brother, who had been the ideal prince.

11:57.870 --> 12:02.420
But your earnest feelings 
weren't understood.

12:02.830 --> 12:07.730
Instead, they broadened the rift 
between you and your father.

12:08.590 --> 12:16.420
And while doing that, you lost 
sight of your true self, as well.

12:16.690 --> 12:22.380
But your late mother told you 
who you were meant to be.

12:23.120 --> 12:24.690
You remember, don't you?

12:31.080 --> 12:33.100
Now, Matilda...

12:33.100 --> 12:35.540
Listen closely to what I'm about to say.

12:40.540 --> 12:43.560
Your life is yours alone.

12:44.150 --> 12:47.390
You should live as you see fit.

12:47.390 --> 12:50.670
Father would never allow that.

12:52.000 --> 12:54.310
Then I will convince him.

12:54.310 --> 12:55.420
Really?

12:57.240 --> 12:59.530
Don't worry, Matilda.

12:59.950 --> 13:04.620
Even Father just wants you to be happy.

13:07.220 --> 13:09.780
You are standing at a crossroads.

13:10.230 --> 13:14.170
Will you live as an ideal princess 
like your father wants,

13:14.650 --> 13:20.050
or will you live as an ideal prince 
in your brother's place?

13:23.750 --> 13:26.620
Sensei, I...

13:28.940 --> 13:30.410
Indeed.

13:33.090 --> 13:37.930
Neither of those are your path.

13:39.730 --> 13:41.470
You are Tama.

13:52.460 --> 13:58.450
It's up to you to write 
the rest of the story.

14:00.210 --> 14:02.760
<i>Is that the crest of the divine beast?</i>

14:03.460 --> 14:05.440
That's amazing, Matilda!

14:05.870 --> 14:10.570
It's still faint, but this is a sign you'll 
develop the crest of the divine beast.

14:10.820 --> 14:13.300
We should tell Father 
about this right away.

14:13.300 --> 14:14.030
Wait!

14:14.540 --> 14:16.720
Don't tell Father.

14:17.780 --> 14:22.930
Father is opposed to me 
practicing martial arts at all.

14:23.750 --> 14:26.090
He wouldn't be happy about it.

14:26.640 --> 14:29.290
Please, Leon.

14:29.290 --> 14:30.510
Matilda...

14:31.260 --> 14:36.240
Since that day, the light hasn't 
appeared in Matilda's arms.

14:36.850 --> 14:38.850
I locked it away.

14:39.240 --> 14:44.850
I locked away her natural gifts because 
I wanted to shield her from danger.

14:45.690 --> 14:49.320
Forgive me, Matilda. Your father was a fool.

14:50.970 --> 14:54.650
But you understood, Lapama.

14:55.530 --> 14:58.150
Well, this is interesting.

14:58.940 --> 15:02.990
I've finally finished digesting 
the flesh of the king of Grün.

15:02.990 --> 15:07.600
If this were a manga or anime, 
now that you've awakened your powers,

15:07.600 --> 15:10.880
you'd defeat me and enjoy a happy ending.

15:10.880 --> 15:13.340
But that won't happen.

15:13.340 --> 15:16.980
Because I am a predator.

15:16.980 --> 15:21.800
You livestock are doomed to be 
eaten by me as you despair.

15:24.580 --> 15:26.770
We'll see about that.

15:28.930 --> 15:32.490
Though we're frequently deceived by hope,

15:32.490 --> 15:38.370
we are similarly deceived 
by despair, as well.

15:39.340 --> 15:44.980
Even when we're pushed into 
the depths of despair,

15:44.980 --> 15:47.880
we'll find a single thread of hope.

15:49.590 --> 15:52.840
<i>Lapama, Leon. Please protect her.</i>

15:52.840 --> 15:53.770
Now!

15:53.770 --> 15:55.230
Get him!

15:55.230 --> 15:56.890
Tama!

15:57.410 --> 16:01.930
You fool! My Gluttony 
consumed your father's arm!

16:02.270 --> 16:05.310
I've mastered his skill, as well!

16:06.710 --> 16:07.990
Cat Distraction.

16:09.950 --> 16:11.100
Cat Headbutt.

16:13.000 --> 16:16.860
Y-You livestock!

16:18.630 --> 16:20.580
Divine Beast Feast Ultimate Technique:

16:28.350 --> 16:29.350
King's Fang.

16:34.590 --> 16:38.100
But you're just livestock...

16:55.370 --> 16:56.570
Tama!

16:56.960 --> 16:59.850
Your Majesty, we'll heal her wounds.

16:59.850 --> 17:01.560
Thank you.

17:05.020 --> 17:07.480
You did well.

17:07.480 --> 17:10.260
You were awesome, Tama.

17:12.060 --> 17:14.560
You can have this back.

17:15.210 --> 17:17.430
That's my wife's...

17:18.030 --> 17:20.580
You read her diary without her permission?

17:21.010 --> 17:24.370
Indeed I did. Will you 
sentence me to death again?

17:24.370 --> 17:25.020
No.

17:25.400 --> 17:31.380
As a father, I'm truly grateful to you 
for saving my daughter and guiding her.

17:34.290 --> 17:37.820
All I did was write my book.

17:40.820 --> 17:42.280
What's this?

17:42.280 --> 17:45.920
Princess Matilda seems to have awakened.

17:46.260 --> 17:50.610
That glow was the light of the 
ultimate technique, King's Fang.

17:50.610 --> 17:54.180
Yes. My daughter pulled 
off an impressive feat.

17:54.180 --> 18:00.660
But her King's Fang is still incomplete.

18:06.120 --> 18:07.380
You're kidding, right?

18:07.380 --> 18:11.140
Impossible. I know her 
King's Fang took him down.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.390
Huh?

18:13.390 --> 18:17.170
Why have I been revived?

18:19.750 --> 18:24.870
Oh, I see. So that's how it is.

18:25.430 --> 18:31.310
Did I tell you I'm one of the seven 
heroes who slew the Dark Lord?

18:31.310 --> 18:38.810
The truth is, I secretly ate the 
flesh of the dead Dark Lord then.

18:38.810 --> 18:40.770
Unbelievable!

18:41.220 --> 18:45.330
I can feel power endlessly 
welling up from inside me.

18:45.840 --> 18:50.880
I've finally become the 
apex predator of this world!

18:53.860 --> 18:56.480
This is the end, livestock!

18:58.410 --> 18:59.240
Huh?

19:10.410 --> 19:12.090
Waldelia...

19:12.480 --> 19:15.970
Y-You're the Dark Lord's daughter.

19:15.970 --> 19:17.350
You're still alive?

19:18.150 --> 19:19.970
Perfect timing.

19:19.970 --> 19:22.440
There's something I wanted to tell you.

19:22.870 --> 19:25.560
Your father was delicious!

19:25.920 --> 19:31.050
When I ate that flesh, I experience 
the joy of living for the first ti—

19:40.880 --> 19:43.880
Sh-She's unbelievably powerful.

19:48.970 --> 19:52.610
Hello, girl with the sad eyes.

19:54.050 --> 19:56.990
Why are you still alive?

19:56.990 --> 20:00.150
He slew your father, did he?

20:01.870 --> 20:05.820
So, do you feel better now?

20:09.370 --> 20:11.530
I'll kill you next time.

20:14.570 --> 20:17.980
S-Sensei is incredible.

20:17.980 --> 20:20.970
He drove off that terrifying woman.

20:22.110 --> 20:28.080
Now that I think about it, 
he's also a sad man who lost his way.

20:29.690 --> 20:34.780
And even after killing him 
and avenging her father,

20:35.310 --> 20:38.250
the sadness remained in her eyes.

20:40.240 --> 20:45.090
Someday, I'd like to write her story.

20:54.910 --> 20:58.980
Thank you for saving the royal capital.

20:58.980 --> 21:01.690
So, the princess...

21:01.690 --> 21:06.230
Yes. She chose to remain at 
the castle to support the king.

21:06.230 --> 21:09.960
We'll miss her, but it's 
the decision Tama made.

21:11.490 --> 21:13.300
I see.

21:20.180 --> 21:22.470
What are you doing here?

21:23.120 --> 21:24.200
Father.

21:24.650 --> 21:27.800
This room is for ladylike princesses,

21:27.800 --> 21:30.780
not for tomboys.

21:30.780 --> 21:33.760
Didn't the travelers already leave town?

21:34.620 --> 21:37.060
You should go with them.

21:37.060 --> 21:39.310
B-But I—

21:39.310 --> 21:44.960
I'm not so old that I need the protection 
of a greenhorn who lacks training.

21:45.370 --> 21:46.650
Father...

21:47.400 --> 21:48.560
However...

21:48.950 --> 21:53.100
You will return here once 
you've finished your journey.

21:53.690 --> 21:55.570
Understood, Matilda?

22:01.550 --> 22:02.180
Eh?

22:02.180 --> 22:05.590
H-Hey, wait! What are you 
doing? How shameless!

22:05.590 --> 22:08.750
You unbelievable little... Stop that!

22:08.750 --> 22:10.340
Thank you, Father!

22:11.670 --> 22:16.920
I'll become an awesome, powerful martial 
artist like you by the time I return!

22:16.920 --> 22:18.350
I'll be back!

22:23.780 --> 22:27.430
How awkward indeed.

22:28.470 --> 22:32.830
Is that the only way you know how to 
speak to your departing daughter?

22:32.830 --> 22:33.790
Master!

22:34.180 --> 22:35.620
What are you talking about?

22:35.620 --> 22:39.140
I know she understood how I feel this time.

22:39.140 --> 22:40.990
Are you sure about that?

22:48.910 --> 22:52.470
<i>Right, Leon and Lapama?</i>

22:59.800 --> 23:02.690
Nir-kun. Hey, Nir-kun.

23:02.690 --> 23:04.760
What is it, Sensei?

23:05.740 --> 23:12.330
Unfortunately, unlike Annette-kun, you have 
absolutely no knack for dragging a coffin.

23:12.330 --> 23:13.670
Wha—

23:13.670 --> 23:15.370
You're no longer allowed to pull.

23:15.370 --> 23:17.850
Then walk on your own two legs!

23:19.060 --> 23:21.740
It seems that won't be necessary.

23:33.470 --> 23:39.020
<b>Tama has
joined the</b>

23:33.470 --> 23:39.020
<b>party.</b>
